"language":"JavaScript","description":"Week 11 Homework","topics":[],"score":224605,"global_rank":158820},{"name":"samuelsholib/weather-dashboard","owner":"samuelsholib","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelsholib/weather-dashboard","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"This is a repo where you could be able to see a weather forecast of some of the major cities in the world. It has a weather dashboard with form inputs When you click on the search button and search for a city, Then you will be  presented with current and future conditions for that city and that city is added to the search history. When you view current weather conditions for that city, Then you be presented with the city name, the date, an icon representation of weather conditions, the temperature, the humidity, the wind speed, and the UV index. When you view the UV index, Then you will be presented with a color that indicates whether the conditions are favorable, moderate, or severe. When you view a future weather conditions for that city, Then  you will be  presented with a 5-day forecast that displays the date, an icon representation of weather conditions, the temperature, the wind speed, and the humidity. When you click on a city in the search history, Then you will be presented with current and future conditions for that city.","topics":[],"score":224605,"global_rank":158821},{"name":"aptaylor87/Jasmine","owner":"aptaylor87","html_url":"https://github.com/aptaylor87/Jasmine","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224605,"global_rank":158822},{"name":"AnthonyPatton/movie-finder","owner":"AnthonyPatton","html_url":"https://github.com/AnthonyPatton/movie-finder","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Movie finder app with search ability. ","topics":["material","reactjs"],"score":224605,"global_rank":158823},{"name":"max-winderbaum/mens-anthem",